    "26-year-old man presented with 12 hours of nausea, vomiting, right lower quadrant pain, and loss of appetite.",
    "Pain initially began periumbilically, migrated to the right lower quadrant, was sharp, and worsened with movement, cough, sneeze, and ambulation.",
